Alembic migration scripts for the agent-mcp router-level identity
database (router.db). Separate Alembic tree from the per-project
migrations under `agent_mcp/migrations/` — the router DB holds
users, sessions, and project_membership; per-project DBs hold tasks,
agents, RAG chunks, etc.

At runtime the router's lifespan calls
`agent_mcp.router.migrations_runner.run_router_migrations_upgrade()`,
which constructs an Alembic Config pointed at the router DB and runs
`command.upgrade(config, "head")`. Idempotent: re-running on an
already-migrated DB is a no-op.

Manual usage (rare — the runtime path covers nearly all needs):

    AGENT_MCP_ROUTER_DB=/var/lib/agent-mcp/router.db \
        alembic -c agent_mcp/router/migrations/alembic.ini upgrade head

(or use the runner directly from a Python shell).
